	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Quick Remote

## Keywords

- `remote [query]` — SSH config entries + saved/cached VNC devices. Refreshes Bonjour cache.
- `ssh [query]` — SSH config entries only.
- `vnc [query or address]` — saved/cached VNC entries. Accepts direct `vnc://` input.

## Actions

- SSH Return → `ssh` in Alfred's default terminal.
- SSH Command-Return → `nvim oil-ssh://user@host/` in Alfred's default terminal.
- VNC Return → `/usr/bin/open` selected URL.

## Command-Return dependencies

- Neovim (`nvim`)
- `oil.nvim`

Both must exist in terminal `PATH`.

## VNC configuration

Add one saved VNC URL per line. Passwords remain functional but stay masked in Alfred results.</string>
